  "headline": "FDA's shortage list for bumetanide injection is Resolved; first posted 2017-12-13 and last updated 2026-09-30",
  "headline_cites": ["D9", "E29"],
  "sentences": [
    {
      "text": "FDA's shortage list shows bumetanide injection as Resolved with an initial posting on 2017-12-13 and a last update on 2026-09-30.",
      "cites": ["D9", "E29"]
    },
    {
      "text": "The posting lists multiple manufacturers — MSN Laboratories Private Limited, Fresenius Kabi USA LLC, Hikma Pharmaceuticals USA Inc., Mullan Pharmaceutical Inc., and Sagent Pharmaceuticals — all marked Resolved.",
      "cites": ["E24", "E25", "E26", "E27", "E28"]
    },
    {
      "text": "An FDA inspection of a Zydus Lifesciences Limited plant (FEI 3005430968) ended 2015-05-23 and was classified VAI, 935 days before the 2017-12-13 posting.",
      "cites": ["D7", "E21"]
    },
    {
      "text": "A later inspection of the same Zydus plant ended 2019-09-10, classified VAI, 636 days after the posting.",
      "cites": ["D8", "E14"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Hikma Pharmaceuticals USA Inc. (FEI 2220525) has a series of VAI inspections from 2009 through 2024, with the most recent ending 2024-06-12.",
      "cites": ["E10", "E11", "E12", "E13", "E14", "E15", "E16"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Zydus Lifesciences Limited received a Warning Letter on 2026-06-02.",
      "cites": ["E22"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Current hospital inventory shows 1.4 to 38.2 days on hand across presentations and sites; the best rule-based option is to buy from Advagen Pharma Limited, which is not on FDA's shortage list today.",
      "cites": ["D1", "D2", "D3", "D4", "D5", "D6", "D10"]
    }
  ]
}
